WEBVTT

00:11:58.256 --> 00:12:00.558
That means you can do
all banking transactions --

00:12:00.558 --> 00:12:02.953
send and receive money,
pay with your debit card --

00:12:02.953 --> 00:12:05.321
all with no additional charge.

00:12:05.321 --> 00:12:09.222
This is what I call low-cost banking
without the bank.

00:12:09.222 --> 00:12:13.665
Amazingly, 75 percent
of the customers using this service

00:12:13.665 --> 00:12:18.463
are the middle-class French
who can't afford high banking fees.

00:12:18.463 --> 00:12:22.875
Now, I talked about frugal innovation,
initially pioneered in the South,

00:12:22.875 --> 00:12:24.965
now being adopted in the North.

00:12:24.965 --> 00:12:27.333
Ultimately, we would like to see

00:12:27.333 --> 00:12:29.678
developed countries
and developing countries

00:12:29.678 --> 00:12:32.743
come together and co-create
frugal solutions